OL,3,ASix thousand Italian schools hit by
OL,4,Athreats in suspected bomb hoax
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe emails were sent to schools in
OL,7,FRome, Naples, Milan, Genoa, Vicenza,
OL,8,FFlorence, Pisa, Trieste and many other
OL,9,FItalian cities, and a number of
OL,10,Fbuildings were evacuated as a
OL,11,Fprecaution.
OL,13,FPrime Minister Giorgia Meloni summoned
OL,14,Ftop ministers and intelligence chiefs,
OL,15,Fwhile opposition leaders were due to
OL,16,Fmeet her on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
